# Part 3 – n8n Automation Workflows

## Workflow 1 – Task Creation

### Flow

**New Task in Notion → n8n Notion Trigger → Slack Notification**

When a new task is added to the Notion database, n8n detects the new record and sends a notification to the selected Slack channel.

### n8n Nodes

* Notion Trigger
* Slack – Send a Message

---

## Workflow 2 – Client Onboarding

### Flow

**New Client in Notion → n8n Notion Trigger → Create Slack Channel → Notify Team**

When a new client is added to the Notion client database, n8n creates a Slack channel and sends a notification to the team.

### n8n Nodes

* Notion Trigger
* Slack – Create a Channel
* Slack – Send a Message

---

## Workflow 3 – Google Student Registration

### Flow

**Google Form → Google Sheets → n8n → Notion**

When a student submits the registration form, the response is stored in Google Sheets. The n8n workflow detects the newly added row and creates a corresponding record in the Notion student database.

### Example Data

| Name  | Email                                     | Course        | Status |
| ----- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------ |
| Ahmad | [ahmad@gmail.com](mailto:ahmad@gmail.com) | AI Automation | New    |

### n8n Nodes

* Google Sheets Trigger
* Notion – Create a Database Page

